      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When the engine stops, it's often the quiet before you can decide what kind of vehicle you want to build next, and that pause can feel terrifyingly empty. You don't have to \"fix\" anything right now; you just have to allow yourself to feel this enormous void. Give yourself permission to simply exist in this emptiness for a while, without the pressure of needing to be productive or defined.",
